    <briefdescription>
<para>Exception types and helper macros for ONNX version conversion errors. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides the ConvertError exception class and the <ref refid="errors_8h_1ad5d6032d694d5f4a81d81e0c5ce3caa8" kindref="member">fail_convert()</ref> macro used throughout the version_converter subsystem to report unsupported or invalid version-conversion operations. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
